  If a homogeneous admixture C*t^-(1+r+b) were present in G_r, then
  n^2*R at fixed m would blow up like n^2 * (1/n) * (m/n)^-(1+r+b) ~ n^(r+b),
  i.e. by factors of ~5^(r+b) per column.  Observed: bounded / converging.

